    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:LeisWl">Leis Wl</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="xno" source="#robertson" n="11" corresp="#wit-hk">Si ceo avient que aucuns coupe le puing a l'auter u le pié, si lui rendrad demi were sulunc ceo qu'il est nez.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-hk">If it happens that a man cuts off the hand or foot of another, he shall pay him (as compensation) half his wergeld according to his inherited rank.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Added October 2026 from Robertson pp. 258–259 (text and translation); Liebermann’s text (K–M) not yet added</note>
      </div>
